sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API as API (ingest)
  participant Router as ModelRouter
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Client->>API: POST /candidates/cv or /tdrs
  API->>API: parse file to raw text
  opt TDR
    API->>API: chunk, embed (Ollama), retrieve top chunks
  end
  API->>Router: invoke_structured_extraction(chunk/doc)
  Router->>Router: rotate Groq -> Gemini -> Ollama
  Router-->>API: wire-level extraction result
  API->>API: validate & coerce into domain model
  API->>DB: persist (flush between parent/child)
  DB-->>API: rows committed
  API-->>Client: structured CandidateCV / TDR
